==Battleground==
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~13.33 seconds<sup>20f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~16.67 seconds<sup>100f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can be very useful here, as all the enemies are either [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]]. If you have any [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], then they can be very useful for this stage. Otherwise, you can use units with over 500 range (like [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Li'l Nyandam]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]]) to help with chipping THE FOLIVOREAN's health.

